2026-07-27T10:29:25.9198149Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:29:25.9198448Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:29:25.9198781Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:29:25.9199170Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:29:25.9199711Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:29:25.9200250Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
